@startuml F3_TenantInvoice_Billing_State
title Tenant Invoice Billing / Payment State Machine\nBoxes = TenantInvoiceStatus enum only · Arrows = who + what\n1 start · ends at PAID / CANCELLED

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #333333
  FontSize 13
  FontStyle bold
}

[*] --> PENDING : System / Manager issue invoice\n(rent cron, utility, service,\nmaintenance complete/handover,\nonboard deposit)

PENDING --> PAID : Tenant pay PayOS QR\nOR Manager verify cash claim
PENDING --> OVERDUE : System mark overdue\n(cron after due date)
PENDING --> PARTIAL : System / payment\npartial amount
PENDING --> CANCELLED : Admin / System cancel\n(void invoice)

PARTIAL --> PAID : Tenant pay remaining
PARTIAL --> OVERDUE : System mark overdue\n(cron)
PARTIAL --> CANCELLED : Cancel

OVERDUE --> PAID : Tenant pay PayOS\nOR Manager verify claim
OVERDUE --> CANCELLED : Cancel

note right of OVERDUE
  MAINTENANCE overdue:
  may set contract
  terminationProposed
  (BillingCron)
end note

PAID --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

@enduml
